IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOOPS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 I          PIC 9(3).
01 J          PIC 9(3).
01 N          PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM INIT-PARA
    PERFORM WORK-PARA THRU DONE-PARA
    PERFORM WORK-PARA 3 TIMES
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N
        DISPLAY I
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3
              AFTER J FROM 1 BY 2 UNTIL J > 5
        DISPLAY I J
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM N TIMES DISPLAY "x" END-PERFORM
    PERFORM WITH TEST AFTER UNTIL I = 0
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM I
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM UNTIL I > 10 ADD 1 TO I END-PERFORM
    GO TO FINISH-PARA.
INIT-PARA.
    MOVE ZERO TO I J.
WORK-PARA.
    DISPLAY "work".
DONE-PARA.
    EXIT.
FINISH-PARA.
    STOP RUN.
